  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program Dev and Consultancies 2016 - NS 2016-2020: Coordinator Grupos Coperantes 2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programutveckling och konsultinsats 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fonden ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r strategiskt viktiga aktiviteter i form av kortsiktiga insatser som t ex st&#xf6;d till insatser inom ramen f&#xf6;r samarbetsstrategin och verksamhetsuppdraget fr&#xe5;n Sida med fokus p&#xe5; Sveriges unika roll i fredsprocessen och dess dialoger, men &#xe4;ven uppdrag som konsultst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r metodutveckling, koordinering, kommunikation och analyser i samband med beredning av nya insatser, granskningar och utv&#xe4;rderingar, samt tj&#xe4;nster i form av t ex juridisk r&#xe5;dgivning, tolkning och &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttning kan komma ifr&#xe5;ga.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund shall be used for strategically important activities in the form of short-term actions such as support for actions within the framework of the cooperation strategy and mission from Sida with a focus on Sweden&apos;s unique role in the peace process and its dialogues, but also assignments such as consultancy support for method development, coordination, communication and analysis in connection with the preparation of new operations, audits and evaluations, as well as services in the form of legal advice , interpretation and translation may be considered.</narrative>
  </description>
